      "id": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/823753865330589696",
      "url": "https://myjetpack.tumblr.com/post/823753865330589696",
      "title": "My latest New Scientist cartoon ",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s640x960/c0dd5122bc6f82e7d7855b8f473f500202ccdb6f.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"560\" data-orig-width=\"840\" alt=\"Panel one: a climber reaches the top of a towering cliff. There, among the clouds, a serene figure with a long beard, wearing a robe, sits crosslegged on the bare rock. He is &quot;The Great Wise One of the Mountain&quot;  Panels two, three and four: sitting serenely crosslegged on successively lower clifftops we see the Assistant Wise One of the Mountain, The Post-Doc Research Fellow of the Mountain and a group of  PhD Students of the Mountain\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s75x75_c1/57e4ef05130b84d1f1ead13eacbe45e9c3558b06.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s100x200/575287f3b7edad672a935a9ee5f596a8a3513d07.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s250x400/aec0a12be7bf3de06c881b881102b3f0e2e74f37.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s400x600/3cafbce9836f849ed486d2e0c097cdfce3a7981d.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s500x750/c0bae7b31f29e738761fc8ea11fdb955dc3168bf.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s540x810/eacabc84e53250f1f3285de39d40632f27012c2c.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s640x960/c0dd5122bc6f82e7d7855b8f473f500202ccdb6f.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/d73879b35caccaee8f3bdca39b6f5c4d/26427ebb3035d154-41/s1280x1920/10d932caaab9aa25d5b99d8951674b985ad83242.jpg 840w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 840px) 100vw, 840px\"/>"
