      "title": "A notebook doodle and original drawing for the punctuation cartoon that I posted recently&hellip;.",
      "content_html": "<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s640x960/6bad2c2ee1dea8975f37cd81a53ec036ffb8fd32.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1399\" data-orig-width=\"1929\" alt=\"A wobbly drawing in a notebook showing a building with commas, periods, asterisks etc blowing out of the window. &quot;Window left open at punctuation factory&quot; is written above.\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s75x75_c1/5eaa26f7c1f99768d7a76151ed0aed31e22c27f3.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s100x200/67749aa372332bb37673a4c506eb32cc72fa2cbb.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s250x400/6ee0fb73f50978c4c880da7226a21d629fb03859.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s400x600/fdd8193ca4665da0945de2d1b344f2c5cd0cdf12.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s500x750/41647c48989e74435d891f4346aaad7fb001317f.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s540x810/fbf4ade7785dfdc17aa7b8ec20d687567a7effe3.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s640x960/6bad2c2ee1dea8975f37cd81a53ec036ffb8fd32.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s1280x1920/d5cbf4ec612349225bbde3dc7973d5d460cdd54f.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/201e649016fb1768a74a0e50eff82b78/b50b9e024875b0bf-5f/s2048x3072/9ee07c57b2d7202c4585f341af874eeb851e93a2.jpg 1929w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>\n<img src=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s640x960/51fc1655a064d0a14647e0ac95920d62473f234f.jpg\" data-orig-height=\"1399\" data-orig-width=\"1929\" alt=\"Panel 1&#10;Caption: With the windows open in the summer heat, a breeze blows through the punctuation factory, scattering newly-minted marks across the countryside.&#10;&#10;Image: a small factory with windows open and punctuation marks coming out &#10;&#10;Panel 2&#10;Caption: Confused locals find their conversations peppered with unexpected pauses and unwanted emphasis.&#10;&#10;Image: Two people talking as punctuation marks float around them One says&#10;&#10;This, is &#xE2;&#x80;&#x9C;very odd&#xE2;&#x80;&#x9D;&#10;&#10;The other replies &#10;&#10;&#xE2;&#x80;&#xA6;(Indeed)*&#10;&#10;&#10;Panel 3&#10;Caption: Naturalists note that the effect is not limited to human communication. &#10;&#10;Image: A duck on a pond surrounded by punctuation marks says&#10;Qu&#xE2;&#x80;&#x99;ack?&#10;&#10;Panel 4&#10;Caption: Fortunately, a cloud of exclamation points drift into a district council meeting which proceeds with unusual efficiency &#10;&#10;Image: Councillors talk in a cloud of exclamation points&#10;Something must be done!!  !&#10;Close the windows! !!&#10;Install air conditioning! !!\" srcset=\"https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s75x75_c1/493373ca56dbc33a4c51d7e4cffe8532dd9d5583.jpg 75w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s100x200/0bd0bf422dadfe3eb654ccdfafd5b1e2281ae646.jpg 100w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s250x400/5330d3d6d3a9ab59b6c689a8f1f772ae963286f1.jpg 250w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s400x600/926064ab329f52fb407953240566324a30015317.jpg 400w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s500x750/e27a792e6f9ca7ebf157cb6ae8fbbde48f20d738.jpg 500w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s540x810/dace900622618f88463f527e21ff03c0ef004ebe.jpg 540w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s640x960/51fc1655a064d0a14647e0ac95920d62473f234f.jpg 640w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s1280x1920/c090138e32c124721683ce001d4cb12b5827a262.jpg 1280w, https://64.media.tumblr.com/c204dd09de407cee713fc62bc3c3d5f3/b50b9e024875b0bf-90/s2048x3072/280fafb71b46ed505d8d47db4ad65a54876337a3.jpg 1929w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1280px) 100vw, 1280px\"/>"
